; M6 remapped (INI [RS274NGC] REMAP): a tool change with the power drawbar.
; Z up, release the old tool, LinuxCNC's own M6 (the manual tool change prompt: swap the tool and
; confirm), then clamp the new one. Unloading (T0) leaves the drawbar released.
o<milo_m6> sub
o100 if [#<_selected_tool> EQ #<_current_tool>]
  o<milo_m6> return [1]
o100 endif
G53 G0 Z0
o<drawbar_release> call
M6
o110 if [#<_selected_tool> NE 0]
  o<drawbar_clamp> call
o110 endif
o<milo_m6> endsub [1]
M2
